/A 3301 0 R
/Alt (The two-panel box plot graph shows accuracy percentage on the vertical axis from 10 to 100. Both panels include a legend for NPS, RVS, and TDS strategies. Panel A displays task-level performance, with tasks DJ, DS, PJ, PDR, and PP on the horizontal axis. For DJ, RVS shows the highest median accuracy around 58 percent. For DS, RVS also shows the highest median around 75 percent. For PJ, all three strategies show similar high median accuracy around 75 percent. For PDR, TDS shows the highest median around 35 percent, with all strategies performing lower than other tasks. For PP, RVS shows the highest median around 60 percent. Panel B displays model-level performance, with models GPT, Gemini, Claude, Qwen, and DeepSeek on the horizontal axis. For GPT, RVS shows the highest median around 57 percent. For Gemini, all three strategies show very high and similar median accuracy around 93 to 94 percent. For Claude, NPS and RVS show higher median accuracy around 80 percent compared to TDS around 60 percent. For Qwen, RVS shows the highest median around 68 percent. For DeepSeek, TDS shows the highest median around 50 percent, with NPS being significantly lower around 30 percent.)
